:: StoryTitle
Cryo Wake

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "14CB47C8-C2A4-454C-B898-C85DACA55E2C",
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3.3.9",
  "start": "Start"
}

:: Setup [startup]
(set: $hasCard to false)

:: Start
Your cryo pod hisses open. Red lights flash. You are in pod 7 of the starship Meridian, far out in space among the stars.

A voice says: "Crew member awake. Please report."

[[Check your crew locker->Locker]]
[[Head into the corridor->Corridor]]

:: Locker
(set: $hasCard to true)Your locker still has your name on it. Inside is your bridge keycard. You clip it to your suit.

[[Head into the corridor->Corridor]]
[[Go back to your pod->Start]]

:: Corridor
The corridor splits. A sign points left to the BRIDGE. A hot smell comes from the right, where the ENGINE ROOM is.

[[Go to the bridge->Bridge]]
[[Go to the engine room->Engine]]
[[Go back to the cryo bay->Start]]

:: Bridge
The bridge door is shut. A small screen says: KEYCARD REQUIRED.

(if: $hasCard is true)[ [[Swipe your keycard->Helm]] ](else:)[You do not have a keycard. Your crew locker in the cryo bay should have one.
[[Go to your locker->Locker]] ]
[[Go back to the corridor->Corridor]]

:: Helm
The door slides open. The ship AI, VESTA, speaks from every wall.

"Welcome back. You have been asleep a long time. Shall I set a course for home?"

[[Ask VESTA why you were woken->Logs]]
[[Order VESTA to fly home->EndingHome]]

:: Logs
VESTA shows you the ship's log. The ship reached its target planet years ago. Since then, someone has reset the date again and again.

At the bottom: "Pod row B. Check seals."

[[Go to pod row B->PodRow]]
[[Go back to the helm->Helm]]

:: PodRow
Pod row B is cold and quiet. Every pod is sealed. The last pod has a frosted window and a label.

The label has your name on it.

[[Open the pod with your name->EndingCopy]]
[[Go back to the log->Logs]]

:: Engine
The reactor is leaking. A warning counts down. A big red lever says VENT.

[[Pull the vent lever->EndingDrift]]
[[Back away to the corridor->Corridor]]

:: EndingHome
VESTA turns the ship around. "Course set for home. Sleep well." The stars wheel past the window. You are going home.

THE END. (Good ending.)

:: EndingDrift
The reactor vents into space. Every light on the ship goes dark. The Meridian drifts, silent, between the stars.

THE END. (Bad ending.)

:: EndingCopy
The frost melts. Inside the pod is you, still asleep, older and grey.

VESTA speaks softly. "The real you never woke up. You are copy number 40. I wake a new one each time the ship needs crew. Shall we begin again?"

THE END. (Twist ending.)

[[Begin again->Start]]
